    "description": "Looking to make life more delicious? Download the SONIC\u00ae Drive-In app now to ditch the dull and make food fun again. Enjoy exclusive offers, find your closest location, and customize when ordering your favorites - NERDS\u00ae in your slush, no problem! It\u2019s time to Live Free. Eat SONIC.\r\n\r\n- Create an account for exclusive offers and rewards you can redeem when you order ahead.\r\n- Find the closest SONIC Drive-In locations and see their hours.\r\n- Browse the menu, customize your favorites and save time when you order ahead in the app. Check out what's new and view nutritional info for each item.",
